OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, crisp start, followed
OL,6,Fby a bright and largely sunny day. The
OL,7,Fodd shower is possible along the
OL,8,FLincolnshire coast, but these mostly
OL,9,Fstaying offshore. Feeling chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cold but dry night with
OL,12,Fextensive clear spells allowing a
OL,13,Ffrost to form, particularly in rural
OL,14,Flocations. Coastal spots could still
OL,15,Fsee the odd shower through the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FAnother cold and frosty start,
OL,18,Fwith plenty of sunshine around.
OL,19,FBecoming cloudier overnight, however
OL,20,Fsome patchy frost is still likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
